## Complex if-elif-else Chains

Sometimes you need many conditions evaluated in sequence. The `elif` chain is perfect for mutually exclusive categories.

```python
temperature = 42
if temperature > 40:
    print("Extreme heat!")
elif temperature > 30:
    print("Hot")
elif temperature > 20:
    print("Warm")
elif temperature > 10:
    print("Cool")
else:
    print("Cold")
```

Order matters: check the highest threshold first.
